# Deploy after major changes

The health stack is live on GCP. After a major change to scoring, the agent, dashboard, MCP, analysis collect, or architecture rules, build and deploy the affected Cloud Run services (`health-agent`, `health-dashboard`, `health-mcp`) before treating the work as done. Git push is not a deploy.

Do not wait to be asked. Rescore or backfill history when the scoring model or rule set changed, using superseded runs rather than overwriting.
